    },
    {
      "id": "2SA.9.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2SA.9.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then the king called to Ziba, Saul's servant, and said to him, I have given to thy master's son all that pertained to Saul, and to all his house.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2SA.9.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2SA.9.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou therefore, and thy sons, and thy servants, shall till the land for him, and thou shalt bring in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the fruits",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", that thy master's son may have food to eat: but Mephibosheth thy master's son shall eat bread always at my table. Now Ziba had fifteen sons and twenty servants.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2SA.9.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2SA.9.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then said Ziba to the king, According to all that my lord the king hath commanded his servant, so shall thy servant do. As for Mephibosheth, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "said the king",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", he shall eat at my table, as one of the king's sons.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2SA.9.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2SA.9.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Mephibosheth had a young son, whose name ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Micah. And all that dwelt in the house of Ziba ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " servants to Mephibosheth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2SA.9.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2SA.9.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So Mephibosheth dwelt in Jerusalem: for he ate continually at the king's table; and was lame in both his feet.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
